---
// Homepage Conversion Rework — Phase 4. Full "Latest Release Highlights"
// content relocated here verbatim from index.astro (was ~450 lines sitting
// directly on the homepage between features and pricing, forcing a cold
// visitor to process advanced functionality like Human Design chart
// calculation before they'd even understood the core promise). Nothing
// here is new or modified — every wn-card below is byte-for-byte the same
// content that lived on the homepage, just relocated. The homepage now
// carries a condensed 4-item teaser linking here.
export const prerender = true;
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Updates — Whisp"
  description="What's new in Whisp — the full release log, batch by batch."
>
  <div class="updates-page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">Whisp</span>
      <h1>Everything we've shipped</h1>
      <p class="updates-page-sub">A running log of what's arrived, batch by batch. <a href="/">← Back to home</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="whats-new" id="whats-new">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="wn-header">
        <span class="wn-badge">What's New</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Latest Release Highlights</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">We've been building. A lot. Here's what's arrived, batch by batch.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="wn-period">
        <div class="wn-period-label">
          <span class="wn-period-date">October 2026</span>
          <span class="wn-period-line"></span>
        </div>

        <article class="wn-spotlight" id="coincidences-thoughts">
          <img class="wn-spotlight-img" src="/images/updates/coincidences.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <div class="wn-spotlight-body">
            <div class="wn-label wn-label--premium">New · Featured</div>
            <h3 class="wn-spotlight-title">Coincidences and Thoughts</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Two new ways to keep what you notice: the moments that unexpectedly line up, and the words that arise in you.</p>
            <ul class="wn-spotlight-list">
              <li><strong>Coincidences.</strong> Under Sign, tell what happened in your own words. That alone is enough to save. Add the connected moments if you like, each with what, where and when, and Whisp states the plain facts of the gap: two places about 300 miles apart, two days apart.</li>
              <li><strong>Meaning stays yours.</strong> A coincidence doesn't have to mean anything; "what are the chances?" is reason enough to note it. If it comes to feel meaningful, mark Whisp's reflection as one that resonates.</li>
              <li><strong>Thoughts.</strong> A new tab for a phrase, a nudge, a prompting that keeps arising in you. Whisp gives it a quiet title and reflects on it with you.</li>
              <li><strong>Threads between them.</strong> When you note a thought worded like one you've noted before, Whisp shows you, and you decide whether they belong together. A coincidence can be linked to the dream, thought or sign it echoes.</li>
              <li><strong>Names stay yours.</strong> Titles and share cards never carry the names of the people in your story.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <div class="wn-grid">

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">☾</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Improved</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Your Entry Comes First</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Home now opens with your latest entry: its art, your words and a way into Whisp's reflection. Everything else arrives once there's something real to show for it.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">✧</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Improved</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">A Quieter Beginning</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Your first entries are celebrated as they happen, and what Whisp has to show you arrives one moment at a time, never all at once.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">✦</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Improved</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Pattern Stories Across the Months</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Whisp now looks for a thread across your months, not just your last few weeks, and shows the one that rests most on your own words. When nothing has taken shape yet, it says so.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">☁</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Improved</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Dreams, Kept</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">A dream's meaning and its reflections are saved with the dream, there the moment you open it, on any device.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◌</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">A Gentle Note When It's Ready</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Ask Whisp to let you know when a reflection is ready or a pattern forms. Notifications are fewer and quieter overall, and they stop if you step away.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">✉</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Send Just the Words</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">When you share a few lines from a reflection, you can send them as plain text, with no page and no link.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">❋</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Improved</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Birds of the Night Sky</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">The gallery behind your Pattern Stories now holds hawks, owls, eagles, cardinals, jays and more, chosen to match the sign a story is about.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">❝</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Share Just a Line</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Press and hold a reflection, or a go-deeper response, to choose a line or two to share. Adjust it a word at a time, add a note of your own, and send only that.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◷</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Improved</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Significant Events, in Journal</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Significant Events now sit alongside your journal entries, for the bigger moments of a year. Dream symbols can be added from + Symbol.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">✧</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Improved</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Every Entry Counts</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Thoughts and coincidences count toward your entries on Home, your streak and your Year in Review.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">❋</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Improved</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">A Larger Gallery</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">A much larger library of artwork for your Weaves, dream cards and patterns, chosen to fit what each one is about.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card" id="places">
            <div class="wn-icon">◉</div>
            <div class="wn-label wn-label--premium">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Places — Where Your Signs Find You</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Your signs on a map, from the whole world down to around home. Name the places that matter and Whisp gathers what you notice there, mentioning a place only once it holds a few moments. Private by design.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card" id="places-deeper">
            <div class="wn-icon">⌖</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Places</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Search as You Write</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Type a café, a street or a town in any entry and pick it from your phone's maps, or drop a pin when you want to be exact. A sign with a place shows a small map of where it found you.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◎</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Places</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Place Reflections</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Once a place holds five moments, Whisp can reflect on what it may hold for you, drawn only from what you logged there, with one question to sit with. Your first is free.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⌂</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Places</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Homes and Journeys</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Add the homes you've lived in as chapters to look back through. Set an intention before a trip, or let Whisp gather a time away, and receive a Trip Story when you're home.</p>
          </div>


          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">✦</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Pattern Stories From Your Reflections</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Whisp looks for the thread running through your reflections and links each story back to the signs and dreams it came from, saying plainly when there isn't one yet. Tell Whisp whether it fits; earlier stories are kept, so you can see how your threads change.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">?</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Questions You Can Answer</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">"Sit with this" questions on your signs, stories and connections can now be answered right where they appear.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◐</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Trends, Organised</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Three tabs: Patterns, Over time and Your lens. The Moon Phase Wheel shows which phase your moments fell in and what an even wheel means, your Intention Arc names each intention and where it stands, and the Dream Symbol Constellation shows its symbols in full.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">∿</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Attunement</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">A gentle shape of how much you've been noticing and returning to your moments. No score, no verdict.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">❧</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Keep a Recurring Theme</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">When a theme keeps returning, keep it in your journal as a contemplation to come back to.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">☺</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">The People in Your Story</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Whisp understands a person sign more gently, using only what you've told it about who they are. You can turn people off in patterns from Your Story.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">☾</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Dreams Find Their Place</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Note where you slept and your dreams appear on your map. Places that hold only dreams glow a moonlit violet, and each place shows what returns in the dreams you've had there.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">✎</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Every Dream Gets a Name</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Leave a dream untitled and Whisp gives it a short, evocative title of its own. Long dreams are now read in full.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⌂</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Home, Made Simple</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Set any place as home with one tap, keep past homes with the years you lived there, and find all your homes in Places settings.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◎</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Your Weave, Clearly</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Dreams and journal entries count toward your Weave. You'll see when this week's Weave is on its way, when last week's is ready, and a gentle prompt to add something you remember if last week was quiet.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">✉</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Send a Reflection</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Write a reflection for someone on a dream or sign they can't shake, and see exactly what they'll receive before you send it. They don't need the app.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◈</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Honest by Design</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Your body state is only used when you set it yourself, and turning on notifications in your phone's Settings is recognised straight away.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">❦</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Your Story</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Share a little of your life — the people who matter, the turning points, what you're carrying — and reflections can meet you where you are. A sentence is enough. You choose, piece by piece, what Whisp may use, and you can always see what a reflection drew on. Only you can read it.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">↺</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Recall, Rebuilt</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Bring in the signs you remember from before Whisp: a single moment, a season, a lifelong companion, or a dream that stayed with you. One quick screen, by voice if you like, or from a photo's date. Whisp never invents a date it doesn't know.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◷</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Your History With a Symbol</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">The first time you log a symbol, Whisp asks if you've seen it before. What you remember quietly deepens your reflections — the hawk that's followed you since childhood — without ever being counted as something that happened this week.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">☾</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Dreams, Read More Deeply</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Each dream now opens with the heart of it, then the shape it took, the symbols you can explore one by one, and what it may be working through. Gentler wording throughout, and dream art that arrives as it should.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⟣</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Sharing That Makes Sense</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">See exactly what a friend will see before you send it. Dreams carry Whisp's interpretation, contemplations carry the question they answer, and every share ends with a quiet question for the person receiving it — one they can answer in Whisp.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">❖</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Folklore You Can Answer</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Symbol Folklore now shows each symbol's image, links to the symbol in your own journal, and lets you respond to what a tradition says as a Contemplation of your own.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">✝</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Scripture, in Your Language</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">For Christian users, reflections speak in Biblical terms, and those who follow Christianity alone find Sacred Passage named simply Scripture.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◉</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Speak Instead of Type</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Say your response to a contemplation, or what you remember, out loud. Whisp writes it down for you.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⬡</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Themes That Explain Themselves</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Each Recurring Theme now says, in plain words, why it was grouped — and opens its own page of evidence, so you can see exactly which signs, dreams and entries it came from.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">✧</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">A Gentler First Week</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">New to Whisp? Small, well-timed moments follow your first reflections — never a wall of features — and your very first reflection is on us.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">✎</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Contemplations</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Keep a moment from Through History or the daily reflection prompt as its own journal entry. Write what comes up, let Whisp reflect on your words, then go deeper if you want to.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◎</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Read Through Your Lens</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Before your first sign, tell Whisp how you see the signs in your life — faith, spiritual, cosmic, energy, psychological, or simply curious. Two taps, and every reflection speaks your language, never someone else's.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">✧</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Prayers</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">For Christian, Jewish and Muslim users, intentions become prayers — framed in the language of asking, trust and waiting, never promising outcomes. Vision boards carry a quiet line of faith and a verse from a curated list.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">❖</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Symbol Folklore, Everywhere</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">How different traditions have read a symbol — Norse, Jungian, Indigenous, and more, side by side on their own terms — now sits on each symbol's page and in the Symbol Dictionary.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◌</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Your Tools, Your Way</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Tools outside the lens you chose rest quietly in a Hidden Tools section. Hide anything you don't use, or bring any of it back with a tap — nothing is ever taken away.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⟡</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Alignment That Shows Its Work</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Intention alignment now reads what each intention is about and connects the signs that genuinely share its themes — with a plain note on how it's counted.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">☽</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">A Gentler Start</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">New to Whisp? One simple question — where would you like to begin? — and you're logging a sign, a dream, or your first journal entry right away.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⚿</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Private Entries</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Mark any entry private and it's hidden in the app behind a PIN. Unlock just the one you're reading, or your whole session if you're somewhere safe — your call, every time.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◖</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">A Lock That Shows Its Work</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">A small lock marks every private entry, even once it's unlocked — so you always know what's protected, and can relock it with a tap the moment you're done.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="wn-period">
        <div class="wn-period-label">
          <span class="wn-period-date">September 2026</span>
          <span class="wn-period-line"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-grid">

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⟣</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Shared Links Open Right in the App</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Send someone a reflection, a dream, or a correlation and their tap drops them straight into Whisp — the whole experience, not a preview of it.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◈</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">A Wider Well of Photos</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Sign logs, journal entries, and symbols now search Unsplash alongside Pexels — an even deeper library to find the exact image a moment deserves.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⬢</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">A Growing Gallery of Whisp Art</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Your Weave, Pattern Story, correlations, and dream cards now draw from a growing, hand-curated collection of Whisp-style celestial art — matched to what you're experiencing, ready the instant your reflection is.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⚝</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">More Ways to Shape Your Dream Art</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Ask for a new vision, redo the whole card, or bring back the one you loved — dream cards now give you the same creative control your Weave already has.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="wn-period">
        <div class="wn-period-label">
          <span class="wn-period-date">August 2026</span>
          <span class="wn-period-line"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-grid">

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⟠</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Interpretive Lens</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Add a lens — Jungian Archetypes, Human Design, Shadow Work, Parts Work, and more — and your dreams, sign log reflections, and Weave gain an extra read through that framework, sitting alongside your primary reflection rather than replacing it.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">◉</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">My Perspectives</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">See every lens you've added in one place, tell Whisp when an interpretation actually landed, and keep exactly the perspectives that serve you — nothing added stays if it isn't useful.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⟢</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">The Weave, Only When It's Real</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">If a week doesn't have enough of your own words behind it, Whisp says so instead of writing something hollow to fill the space — and a quiet regenerate is always there when you want a fresh read.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">☊</div>
            <div class="wn-label wn-label--sacred">Enhanced · Sacred</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Human Design, Actually Calculated</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Your Human Design profile — Authority, Type, Profile, defined centers — is now calculated from your real birth data instead of relying on what you self-reported, so any reflection that references it is grounded in your actual chart.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⟡</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Deeper Weekly Reflections</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Your Weave and Pattern Story now draw on your actual journal entries, the life context you've written, and dates you've marked significant — not just sign names and moods. A reflection can finally say "this connects to what you wrote in March," not just guess.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⬡</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Recurring Themes</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">Whisp now groups what's showing up by meaning, not just symbol — a theme like transition or partnership spanning your signs, dreams, and journal entries at once, always shown with its own honest evidence count.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">⟐</div>
            <div class="wn-label">Enhanced</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">A Whisper That Feels Like a Moment</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">The "Whisp is Noticing" card on Home now opens with real space for its art before the reflection begins, and the whole card taps straight through to the full pattern — no more hunting for the right link.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wn-card">
            <div class="wn-icon">❈</div>
            <div class="wn-label">New</div>
            <h3 class="wn-title">Life Path Number, Woven In</h3>
            <p class="wn-desc">See your Life Path Number reflected right on a matching symbol's page when a repeating number is genuinely yours — plus threaded quietly into your reflections wherever it actually applies.</p>
